travel Winterspring
accept 8464 Winterfall Activity | Salfa. The Winterfall camp is far east, past Everlook.
complete 8464 Winterfall Activity | Winterfall Shamans, Den Watchers and Ursa at the Winterfall Village east of Everlook.
accept 5055 Brumeran of the Chillwind
accept 977 Are We There, Yeti?
complete 5055 Brumeran of the Chillwind | Brumeran, a chimaera in the south of the zone.
complete 977 Are We There, Yeti? | Pristine Yeti Horn from the Ice Thistle Matriarch, east of Everlook.
turnin 5055 Brumeran of the Chillwind | Storm Shadowhoof, Everlook.
turnin 977 Are We There, Yeti? | Umi Rumplesnicker.
accept 5163 Are We There, Yeti?
complete 5163 Are We There, Yeti?
turnin 5163 Are We There, Yeti?
turnin 8464 Winterfall Activity | Salfa, back at the tunnel.
